  "Drive skadedyrbekjempelse slik at fôrvarer produseres, bearbeides, pakkes, lagres og transporteres under hensiktsmessige hygieniske forhold.": "Carry out pest control so that feed is produced, processed, packed, stored and transported under appropriate hygienic conditions.",
