  "Ingen nygrøfting. Lukket hogst eller småflatehogst i sump- og myrskog og mot fastmark. Flersjiktet kantsone mot myr (gjelder ikke myrer under {0} daa). Grøftevann ledes ikke rett i vassdrag.": "No new drainage. Continuous cover or small-area harvesting in swamp and bog forest and towards firm ground. Multi-layered riparian zone towards bogs (not bogs under {0} daa). Drainage water is not led straight into watercourses.",
