  "Mulig hogd etter {0}: SR{1} viser {2} m³/daa mot HK {3} i planen – kontroller; Treslag: plan F, SR{4} G": "Possibly harvested after {0}: SR{1} shows {2} m³/daa versus AC {3} in the plan – check; Species: plan P, SR{4} S",
