  "Skogsmaskiner i drift skal ha beredskapspakke: skogbrannstryker, fylt vanndunk på {0} liter, spredekanne og spade/hakke.": "Forest machines in operation must have a preparedness kit: fire beater, filled {0}-litre water can, watering can and spade/pick.",
